This product bundles the following third-party components.

1. html2pptx  —  engine/
   Upstream: https://github.com/GX-Alex/html2pptx
   License:  MIT (full text in engine/LICENSE)
   Notes:    vendored fork; local changes are listed in engine/UPSTREAM.md.

2. Apache ECharts  —  vendor/echarts.min.js
   Upstream: https://github.com/apache/echarts
   License:  Apache License 2.0 (header retained in the bundled file)
   Notes:    shipped so charts still render while the converter runs with no
             network access.

3. Font Awesome Free (icon path data)  —  engine/fontawesome_subset.py
   Upstream: https://fontawesome.com/
   License:  CC BY 4.0 for icons (https://fontawesome.com/license/free)
   Notes:    a small subset of solid-icon path data, inlined so decks that use
             Font Awesome classes still show their icons offline.

Runtime dependencies installed from PyPI (not bundled): python-pptx (MIT),
beautifulsoup4 (MIT).
